  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a79a6f6a3a51d4c64b6ab/step-404ed7c3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut tofu into 2cm cubes. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Slice the capsicum into strips.\n• In a small bowl, combine hoisin sauce, soy sauce and sugar.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a79a6f6a3a51d4c64b6ab/step-119f2ed6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Stir-fry carrot and capsicum until softened, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return pan to the heat with a good drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until golden on all sides, 4-5 mins. Stir in remaining garlic, carrot, and hoisin mixture, cook until bubbling, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a79a6f6a3a51d4c64b6ab/step-6645ccc3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with hoisin tofu.\n• Sprinkle with roasted peanuts and serve with cucumber.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a79a6f6a3a51d4c64b6ab/step-5a8b9ada.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
